    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST NOW</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849910/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.poster.avif?t=1747756023\" width=800 height=66 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849910/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.webm?t=1747756023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849910/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.mp4?t=1747756023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Welcome to the desolate town of <strong>BLOOD CROSSROAD</strong>, where darkness has consumed every corner and the echoes of past horrors linger in the air.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849910/extras/ef5bf85cb76459a046863fea51f49026.poster.avif?t=1747756023\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849910/extras/ef5bf85cb76459a046863fea51f49026.webm?t=1747756023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849910/extras/ef5bf85cb76459a046863fea51f49026.mp4?t=1747756023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>BLOOD CROSSROAD</strong> is a first person psychological horror game that delves into the intricate relationship between a man and alcoholism, weaving a dark and twisted narrative that blurs the lines between man and beast, guilt and shame, addiction and salvation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849910/extras/3af7fcb15049691ad4a34dd1c60451fd.poster.avif?t=1747756023\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849910/extras/3af7fcb15049691ad4a34dd1c60451fd.webm?t=1747756023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Set in a gritty urban landscape full of supernatural elements, the game focuses on William's desperate struggle for control. Uncover William\u2019s connection to an ancient legend from Japanese folklore.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849910/extras/5cfb467400805b5f43a894bbc0b639ed.poster.avif?t=1747756023\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849910/extras/5cfb467400805b5f43a894bbc0b639ed.webm?t=1747756023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849910/extras/5cfb467400805b5f43a894bbc0b639ed.mp4?t=1747756023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Players must confront their own inner demons while navigating through a labyrinth of dark alleys and haunted memories.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849910/extras/92d3892b891e6e9c5fa5e931308ac644.poster.avif?t=1747756023\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849910/extras/92d3892b891e6e9c5fa5e931308ac644.webm?t=1747756023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849910/extras/92d3892b891e6e9c5fa5e931308ac644.mp4?t=1747756023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As you step foot into <strong>BLOOD CROSSROAD</strong>, you'll quickly realize that you're not alone. <br><br>With only your wits and a flickering flashlight, you must navigate a treacherous environment while running from the grasp of malevolent forces determined to claim your soul.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849910/extras/04d2dd876bfdb7cd806e00b1566a4d9d.poster.avif?t=1747756023\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849910/extras/04d2dd876bfdb7cd806e00b1566a4d9d.webm?t=1747756023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849910/extras/04d2dd876bfdb7cd806e00b1566a4d9d.mp4?t=1747756023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Throughout the game, players are confronted with the devastating effects of alcoholism on William's relationships, career, and mental well-being. <br><br>As the line between reality and hallucination blurs, players must unravel the twisted truths hidden within his fragmented memories.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849910/extras/a4ea10116ba47e9a0932a755c41b2baa.poster.avif?t=1747756023\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849910/extras/a4ea10116ba47e9a0932a755c41b2baa.webm?t=1747756023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849910/extras/a4ea10116ba47e9a0932a755c41b2baa.mp4?t=1747756023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>To break free from the cycle of addiction, players must confront William's inner demons and make difficult choices that will determine his fate.<br><br>- <strong>PSYCHOLOGICAL DETERIORATION</strong>: Witness the protagonist's mental state decline as you face unimaginable horrors. <br>- <strong>EXPLORE</strong> eerie environments, searching for keys and clues to unravel the mystery. <br>- <strong>FIND KEYS AND ITEMS</strong> to unlock doors and solve puzzles. <br>- <strong>ESCAPE </strong>from relentless monsters lurking in the darkness.<br><br>Do you have what it takes to uncover the truth behind <strong>BLOOD CROSSROAD</strong>?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849910/extras/fc11e3664d07a2cf16ec0daab8bd4d16.poster.avif?t=1747756023\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849910/extras/fc11e3664d07a2cf16ec0daab8bd4d16.webm?t=1747756023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849910/extras/fc11e3664d07a2cf16ec0daab8bd4d16.mp4?t=1747756023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
